 TAGSINDEX template to render -- none of the four bundled themes ships one, so
 every link this macro emits would 404 on journal, travel, portfolio and
 frontpage alike. A custom theme that DOES supply that template can call it
 and the links work. Do not wire it into a bundled theme without shipping the
 template first.
